@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title WebLLM Weights Loading & Sharding
' URL:   https://webllm.mlc.ai/
' URL:   https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.15803
' Level: n/a (substrate)

node "Browser Memory" <<host>> {
  component "WebLLM Engine" as Engine <<app>>
  component "WebGPU VRAM" as VRAM <<db>>
}

node "Static Server" <<cloud>> {
  artifact "ndarray-cache.json" as CacheMap
  artifact "params_shard_0.bin" as Shard0
  artifact "params_shard_1.bin" as Shard1
  artifact "params_shard_N.bin" as ShardN
}

Engine ARROW_CLOUD CacheMap : 1. Fetch mapping
note right of CacheMap: Maps tensor names to byte offsets\nand specific shard files.

Engine ARROW_CLOUD Shard0 : 2. Fetch Shard 0
Engine ARROW_CLOUD Shard1 : 2. Fetch Shard 1
Engine ARROW_CLOUD ShardN : 2. Fetch Shard N

Engine ARROW_MAIN VRAM : 3. Load Tensors into GPU

note bottom of Engine
  Weights ship as many small shards so a browser
  can fetch them in parallel and stream each into
  VRAM — no single multi-GB download, and progress
  is reportable per shard.
end note
@enduml
